// using these on type make them
   & referance: fancy pointer that can't be non
   # constent : read only
   ? optional : just a pointer
   * pointer  : just a number hold an addrese
   ^ mutable  : can be edit even if it in const scope
   ! owned    : can't be passed directly
   []array    : flat memory space of crrent typ
   ()lambda   : fancy pointer to a function
   {}tuple    : quick struct
   ``directory: a map

